<title>USA: Digital cuts prices on some desktop PCs.</title>
<headline>Digital cuts prices on some desktop PCs.</headline>
<dateline>MAYNARD, Mass. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Equipment Corp said Tuesday it reduced prices by six to 22 percent for its Venturis and Celebris Pentium -and Pentium Pro-based product lines.</p>
<p>Estimated U.S. street prices now start at $1,099 for the entry-level Venturis models.</p>
</text>
